    "description": {
      "en": "Original low-poly direction: establish small domed head plate, median eye and slender trunk with four tail blades in the blockout, then preserve the largest silhouette breaks and openings. Simplify fine ornament and repeated elements without copying reference meshes; palette and presentation are artistic choices, not fossil evidence.",
