    "reconstruction_notes": {
      "en": "Original living whole-organism interpretation: small domed anterior head plate, a large median eye behind it, paired stalked lateral eyes, long segmented trunk, paired swimming flaps, rake-like frontal appendages and four filamentous tail blades. Nominal art proportions and colors; no brain, gill microstructure or exact spine-tooth counts claimed. Soft closed parts deliberately overlap at organic roots; no detached appendage placement.",
      "zh": "原创全身生活复原：小型前部拱头甲、位于甲后的中央眼、两侧具柄眼、细长分节躯干、成对游泳瓣、耙状前附肢与四条丝状尾叶。尺寸比例及色彩为艺术设定；不复原脑或鳃微观结构，不主张精确刺齿数。封闭软组织部件在根部有意交叠连接。"
    },
    "representation": "living-reconstruction",
    "scientific_scope": {
      "en": "Independently reviewed original stylized-inspired static teaching art. Palette, pose, nominal dimensions and simplified anatomy are artistic choices; not a strict scientific reconstruction or coexistence claim.",
